    "intro": {
      "zh": "Microsoft Xbox 360 是微软 2005 年发布的第七代家用游戏机，以 Xenon 处理器、Xbox Live 在线服务与四段电源环灯为标志，是微软在主机市场腾飞的机型，与 Wii、PS3 形成第七代三强格局。",
      "en": "The Microsoft Xbox 360, released in 2005, was a seventh-generation home console powered by the Xenon processor, defined by Xbox Live online services and its iconic power ring."
    },
    "era": 2005, "manufacturer": "Microsoft"
  },
